  "body": "Luxury Living with Exceptional Space & Style\r\n\r\nWelcome to 20 Kikorangi Drive, an impressive residence showcasing elegant design, superior finishes and outstanding spaces for both family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully appointed home offers:\r\n\r\n5 generous double bedrooms\r\n4 spacious living areas\r\n4 luxurious bathrooms, including 3 ensuites\r\nDeluxe designer kitchen complemented by a large scullery\r\nExpansive outdoor decks ideal for entertaining and relaxing\r\nSuperb indoor-outdoor flow from the dining and living areas\r\nFantastic entertaining spaces for gatherings with family and friends\r\nPrivate accommodation for adult children, extended family or Grandma\r\nDesigned for those who appreciate space, quality and versatility, this exceptional home provides luxurious everyday living while offering wonderful separation for extended family.\r\n\r\nA sophisticated home where elegance, comfort and entertaining come together beautifully",
